WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:06.640
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain an American romantic&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:15.920
fantasy film called “The Age Of Adaline.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.640
The protagonist of the movie&nbsp;
is a twentynine-year-old woman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:26.240
named Adaline Bowman. In the beginning, she&nbsp;
walks into an apartment and buys a fake ID&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:32.080
under a different name. She returns back home to&nbsp;
feed her dog then goes to work. It is a normal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:37.440
day in San Francisco for Adaline until her&nbsp;
coworker hands her archives containing reels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:43.200
of historical events. Adaline excitedly agrees&nbsp;
to sort through them and brings the box home.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.880
She sets up a projector and watches videos&nbsp;
of the historic times in fascination. It is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:55.840
narrated that Adaline was actually born on&nbsp;
January 1st, 1908. In 1929, she married a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:01.120
young man named Clarence James and only three&nbsp;
years later, she gave birth to a baby girl,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:07.280
Fleming. Adaline was happiest she could ever be&nbsp;
but her life turned upside down when her husband&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.880
died in a tragic accident during the construction&nbsp;
of the Golden Gate Bridge in 1937. 
&nbsp;

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:18.320
Ten months after her husband’s death, Adaline&nbsp;
was driving to her parent’s cottage. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:24.080
snow fell in the otherwise dry Sonoma County,&nbsp;
California. Adaline had poor visibility on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:30.480
road because of the snowfall which caused her to&nbsp;
crash into a ravine. Tragically, she died freezing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:36.640
in water but something magical happened next. She&nbsp;
was struck by lightning and brought back to life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.480
And from that moment onwards, Adaline hasn’t&nbsp;
aged a second. As she grew older, she realized&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:47.920
she had this unique condition but thought it was&nbsp;
because of a good diet, exercise, and simple luck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:58.560
But as time passed, her appearance at her age&nbsp;
became almost abnormal. Her daughter Fleming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:03.280
grew older and the two started looking&nbsp;
like sisters but Adaline didn’t age. 
&nbsp;

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:08.480
One day, she is pulled over by a policeman&nbsp;
for a minor traffic inconvenience but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:13.440
man doesn’t believe she is forty-five years old.&nbsp;
This makes Adaline realize she cannot live with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:20.560
her condition. Hence, she moves to San Francisco&nbsp;
from her suburban neighborhood to study medicine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:26.240
and research her condition. However, even after&nbsp;
a year of research, she acquires little to no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:31.440
information about her condition. She is eventually&nbsp;
forced to accept the fact that there is no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:36.800
scientific explanation for why she doesn’t&nbsp;
age. One night while returning home, she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:42.640
approached by FBI agents who suspect her of being&nbsp;
a spy because of lack of record of residence. 
&nbsp;

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.840
They pull over their car by a plane and taking&nbsp;
the opportunity, Adaline flees from the place.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:53.280
Starting then, she has always been on a run,&nbsp;
moving from state to state and changing her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:59.520
name every few years. It is currently 2014 and&nbsp;
Adaline is one hundred six years old but neither&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:05.120
her appearance nor her health has changed since&nbsp;
she was twenty-nine. Her daughter Fleming has aged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:10.000
gradually and looks old enough to be Adaline’s&nbsp;
mother. Currently, she is living as Jennifer&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:16.080
Larson and is about to move in seven weeks&nbsp;
under a different name. On her 107th birthday,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:22.080
Adaline’s blind friend Regan invites her to a new&nbsp;
year's eve party. Adaline dresses up beautifully&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:28.080
and arrives at a lavish mansion. There, she sees&nbsp;
decades-old pictures of herself and reminisces&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.080 --> 00:03:33.280
about her friends. Adaline meets Regan who&nbsp;
jokes about only younger men liking her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:37.440
unknown that she doesn’t age. 
While they talk, Adaline locks eyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:43.680
with a handsome young man across the room named&nbsp;
Ellis Jones. They exchange a few glances but do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:48.400
not talk throughout the night. When the clock&nbsp;
hits midnight, Adaline is about to leave when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:53.360
Ellis joins her in the elevator. They introduce&nbsp;
themselves and get to know more about each other.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:58.720
Adaline introduces herself as Jennifer, trying&nbsp;
to stay as away from him as possible. It is clear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:04.320
that Ellis is more interested in her than she is&nbsp;
in him. He awkwardly escorts her out and asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.600
how they can meet again but Adaline leaves after&nbsp;
wishing him a happy new year. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:14.720
she goes to meet Fleming for lunch. The mother&nbsp;
and daughter hug and have a happy conversation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:18.880
Flemings tells Adaline about her plan to&nbsp;
move into a retirement home somewhere far&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:23.200
which Adaline is not happy about because she&nbsp;
wants to stay closer to her daughter. 
&nbsp;

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:35.520
The next day, Adaline is surprised to see Ellis&nbsp;
walk into her work. He has somehow found out where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:41.040
she works and has brought her books as gifts.&nbsp;
This time, he bravely asks her out on a date,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.040 --> 00:04:48.960
and seeing the man try so hard, Adaline agrees.&nbsp;
She asks him to take her to a place she has never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:54.320
been before in San Francisco. Ellis accepts the&nbsp;
challenge and takes her to the recently found&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:59.280
historic tunnel. An impressed Adaline asks him&nbsp;
many questions but when it’s her turn to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:04.880
about herself, she only mentions that she has a&nbsp;
dog. Before leaving, Adaline tells him about her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:10.320
plans to move to a different state soon. Hearing&nbsp;
this Ellis asks her out on a second date and makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:15.600
her accept it after telling an awful joke. 
In the following scene, Adaline goes to Ellis’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.600 --> 00:05:20.000
apartment for their date. Ellis surprises&nbsp;
her again with his innovative dish.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:25.200
The two have a wonderful conversation while&nbsp;
drinking wine and listening to jazz music. Ellis&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.640
tells her about his father who is an astronomer&nbsp;
and is famous for discovering an unusual comet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:39.760
He also reveals that the new year’s party wasn’t&nbsp;
when he first saw Adaline. In fact, he had first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:45.360
seen her a while ago sitting near the library in&nbsp;
a blue dress and instantly felt drawn to her.
&nbsp;

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:50.560
The two look into each other’s eyes and&nbsp;
move closer to kiss but Adaline pulls away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:56.240
refusing to act on her feelings. She is afraid&nbsp;
to be close to anyone since she is always moving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.240 --> 00:06:01.280
and changing her identities. Ellis hides&nbsp;
his disappointment and asks her more about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:06.960
herself. His words overwhelm Adaline and&nbsp;
the two finally kiss. The following morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:12.720
they wake up on Ellis’s bed. As Adaline goes to&nbsp;
work that day, she passes a park and remembers the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:18.320
time a man was waiting for her on the same park&nbsp;
bench. It was her lover from a long time ago who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:23.680
wanted to marry her but Adaline had to leave&nbsp;
him because of her condition. Later, Adaline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:29.920
walks home to her dog lying limp on the floor. 
She rushes him to the vet and finds out that his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:35.840
kidneys have failed so it would be best to put him&nbsp;
down. Later, Adaline returns home distressed and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:43.760
looks at an album with the pictures of dogs she&nbsp;
has had over the years. At night, she is walking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.840
to her apartment when Ellis approaches her with a&nbsp;
bouquet of flowers. He had left her several voice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:53.440
mails which she didn’t answer so he went out of&nbsp;
his way to figure out her address from her work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:56.560 --> 00:07:01.760
Adaline informs him about her dog’s death and&nbsp;
tells him he shouldn’t have invaded her privacy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:06.720
She leaves abruptly after asking him to stay&nbsp;
away. The following day, she meets Fleming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:12.480
again and tells her about Ellis. Fleming advises&nbsp;
her mother to let go and live her life for once.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:20.880
Adaline feels sorry for being rude to Ellis the&nbsp;
other day and goes to his work to apologize.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.880 --> 00:07:25.200
The two then go out for a date at&nbsp;
night. This time, Adaline takes him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:30.080
a drive-in movie theater from the sixties. 
She passionately explains the history of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:35.440
theater to an impressed Ellis. They get in one of&nbsp;
the cars and watch the stars drawn on the ceiling.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:40.160
Ellis then invites her for another date to&nbsp;
his parents’ house for their 40th anniversary.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:45.520
Adaline agrees in the condition that she will&nbsp;
be driving. The next day, they drive to Ellis’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:50.720
parent’s home and pick up Ellis’s sister Kikki&nbsp;
on the way. When the three finally reach there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:56.560
they are welcomed by Ellis’s parents, William&nbsp;
and Kathy. As soon as William sees Adaline,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.560 --> 00:08:02.480
he says her name. Adaline is in shock but corrects&nbsp;
him saying that her name is Jennifer. The two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:07.440
share awkward eye contact after which Adaline&nbsp;
claims that William must have known her mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.440 --> 00:08:12.000
Willam is visibly shaken seeing how much&nbsp;
Jennifer looks like his old friend Adaline,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:17.760
hence, he is in uttermost shock when Jennifer&nbsp;
tells him Adaline passed away a few years ago. 
&nbsp;

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:23.200
After everyone goes to sleep, William pours him&nbsp;
a glass of wine and reminisces about the time he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:28.320
first met Adaline. He was only twenty-six years&nbsp;
old and she was twenty-nine when he helped her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:33.840
fix her car. The two instantly got along and even&nbsp;
though Adaline went by the name Della at the time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:39.280
she told William her real name. The two quickly&nbsp;
fell in love and traveled to America together.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:44.320
It is then revealed that William was the man&nbsp;
who was about to propose to Adaline at the park&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:49.600
but Adaline got to know about it and stood him&nbsp;
up. She actually loved him but couldn’t risk her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:55.200
secret being out. Back in the present, Adaline&nbsp;
cannot fall asleep at night. In the breakfast,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:59.520
Williams again brings up Adaline and&nbsp;
talks about how nice of a person she was.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.520 --> 00:09:04.640
His face lights up when he talks about her and&nbsp;
as he praises her, his wife Kathy gets up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:09.600
walks away. Williams goes behind her to ask&nbsp;
her what is wrong and finds out that she feels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:15.600
like a second option to him after Adaline. 
He reassures her he loves her and the two kiss.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:20.720
The day passes and at night, the family gathers&nbsp;
for a game. They have a tradition of playing a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:27.040
tabletop trivia game that William has a 47 game&nbsp;
winning record. As the family talks, Kikki says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.680
that the comet William discovered is called&nbsp;
Della. The family believes that the name is set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:37.520
after William’s aunt but Adaline realizes he named&nbsp;
it after her. She holds her tears and continues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:42.080
playing the game with the family. She eventually&nbsp;
beats William’s record and wins the game,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:53.200
surprising everyone. A while later, Adaline goes&nbsp;
out for a walk and is startled by William who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:59.040
stargazing. The two have a nice chat and William&nbsp;
tells her he was about to propose to her mother.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:04.000
Before leaving Adaline also confesses that&nbsp;
her mother loved him no matter what.
&nbsp;

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:08.640
In the following scene, Adaline is back in&nbsp;
bed with Ellis. He eventually confesses he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:13.920
has fallen in love with her and cannot imagine&nbsp;
his life without her in it. She smiles but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:18.960
doesn’t say I love you back. The next morning,&nbsp;
Adaline goes for a walk and runs into William.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:24.560
He sees a ladybug on her head and helps her&nbsp;
remove it. While he is at it, William notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:29.680
a scar on Adaline’s wrist that is identical&nbsp;
to the one that his girlfriend Adaline had.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.680 --> 00:10:34.000
He remembers it clearly because he was the&nbsp;
one who stitched the wound for her and even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:38.800
has a picture of them together where Adaline’s&nbsp;
hand is bandaged. He finally confronts her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:44.160
asks her for the truth. Adaline comes clean&nbsp;
and tells him she doesn’t know how it started&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:49.120
but she doesn’t age. She also admits that&nbsp;
her condition was the reason she left him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:54.000
William asks her if she will leave his son as&nbsp;
well. Adaline gets overwhelmed at the question&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:58.480
and runs back to the house in a hurry.
She quickly packs her bags and leaves a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:04.080
note for Ellis who is still in the shower. Like&nbsp;
always, Adaline has decided to run away so she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:10.240
wouldn’t hurt anyone. She takes his car keys and&nbsp;
drives away as William tries to stop her. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:15.280
Ellis comes out of the shower, he is heartbroken&nbsp;
to see the note. He gets dressed and asks William&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.280 --> 00:11:20.640
what he said to Adaline. William just says that&nbsp;
she is not ready for the change. He asks his son&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:26.080
if he actually loves Adaline. Ellis says he does&nbsp;
because nothing in life makes sense without her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:31.440
even though he hasn’t known her for long. Hearing&nbsp;
this, William hands his car key to Ellis urging&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:38.720
him to go look for Adaline. Ellis calls Adaline&nbsp;
numerous times on his way but she ignores all his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:43.920
calls. She pulls over her car coincidentally,&nbsp;
near the same place her accident took places&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.920 --> 00:11:48.560
decades ago. Adaline reminisces about&nbsp;
the times she has run away from life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:53.920
and realizes she loves Ellis too much to stay&nbsp;
without him. She then calls Fleming and tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:53.920 --> 00:12:00.480
her she is going to settle in life. However, after&nbsp;
the call, Adaline gets hit by a speeding car. 
&nbsp;

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:06.880
Her body lies limp by the side of the road and&nbsp;
for the first time in 78 years, it snows in Sonoma&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:12.320
County. As the temperature drops, Adaline&nbsp;
freezes and her heartbeat eventually stops.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.880 --> 00:12:18.640
Just then, Ellies arrives there and performs&nbsp;
CPR to try to bring her back. A while later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:23.680
the paramedics arrive at the scene and place&nbsp;
2 defibrillator paddles on Adaline's chest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:29.040
They administer 750 volts of electricity, similar&nbsp;
to the one she had gotten when the lightning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:34.320
struck her decades ago. Because of it, she finally&nbsp;
takes a breath and is brought back to life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:38.880
In the following scene, Adaline is in the&nbsp;
hospital with Ellis. He apologizes for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:44.400
saying I love you too fast but Adaline kisses&nbsp;
him, claiming that she loves him too. She then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:54.560
opens up about her condition to him and reveals&nbsp;
that she is actually 107 years old. Strangely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:59.840
Ellis is calm even after hearing the truth. 
It is now a year later. Ellis and Adaline are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:04.800
a happy couple living together. Adaline even&nbsp;
has a new puppy that Fleming looks after most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:09.760
of the time. One night, the couple plans to go&nbsp;
out to a New Year’s party. While getting ready,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:15.440
Adaline notices a single grey hair on her&nbsp;
head. The movie ends as it is revealed that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.520
she has started to age again. 
